        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Paul Mercurio\n- Roles: judges, actor, dancer, TV presenter\n- Products: Dancing with the Stars, Dancing with the Stars (New Zealand series 3), Australian version of Dancing with the Stars\n\nFacts:\n- Paul Mercurio was born on 31 March 1963.\n- Paul Mercurio is an Australian actor, dancer, and TV presenter.\n- In Dancing with the Stars (New Zealand series 3), all judges returned except Paul Mercurio.\n- Paul Mercurio did not return as a judge because he wanted to focus more on the Australian version of Dancing with the Stars.",
